  "text": "一处能歇脚的地方。\n\n这里回的是{b}体力{/b}：战斗输了扣体力，扣光这一趟就算失败。你现在有 {vitality} 点。歇脚要让倒计时往前走，每个休息点只能歇一次。\n\n生命和耐力不用歇，每场战斗开打都是满的。体力满着就接着走。",
  "texts": {
    "en": "A place to catch your breath.\n\nResting restores {b}Vitality{/b}: you lose Vitality when you lose a fight, and at zero the run fails. You have {vitality} now. Resting moves the countdown forward, and each rest spot works once.\n\nHealth and Stamina don't need rest: every fight starts with them full. If your Vitality is full, keep going."
  },
